{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在压缩叙事时损失了部分心理因果，尤其S11把“即使对方不需要他，也愿意陪伴”改成“承认自己需要对方”，改变了情感重心；S08、S09也削弱了期待与自我安慰之间的过渡。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的交替排布、关键词加亮和感受词按音乐时点出现，让普通观众更容易边听边扫，迅速抓住每段发生了什么；而且音乐变化、身体感觉和情绪变化之间的对应更细密具体。Y的优势是心理叙事更完整，人物为什么期待、害怕、退缩以及后来如何改变，交代得更充分，尤其S08、S09、S11的因果衔接优于X。综合实际观看体验，我选X，因为它在视听同步和即时理解上更有优势，但并不是叙事解释也全面胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "52cc58f6-0c1c-45bb-ace3-4af9dc3631ca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T075120808633Z", "elapsed_seconds": 102.188, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:53:02.990429+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ec961b498777e4e5d574bdb61803547459244d4a2be77e40def890106b8539e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42